{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:39:14+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:39:14+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"DFDS A/S","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Marine Shipping","country":"Denmark","city":"Copenhagen","website":"https://www.dfds.com","employees":15000,"summary":"DFDS A/S provides freight and passenger transport services in Europe, Türkiye, North Africa, and internationally. It operates in two segments, Ferry Division and Logistics Division. The company engages in the operation of network of ferry routes, including freight-only routes, combined freight and passenger routes, and ferries; owns and operates port terminals and rails; offers freight services to forwarders, hauliers, and manufacturers of heavy goods; and provides passenger services, such as overnight and day crossings. It also offers transport solutions comprising full and part-load transport; contract logistics, which includes warehousing and transport of frozen meat and fish; customs; and control towers for manufacturers of industrial goods and consumables, as well as retailers. The company was founded in 1866 and is headquartered in Copenhagen, Denmark.","exchange":"Copenhagen","currency":"DKK","financial_currency":"DKK","summary_fr":"DFDS A/S fournit des services de transport de marchandises et de passagers en Europe, à Trkiye, en Afrique du Nord et à l'international. Il opère dans deux secteurs, la Division Ferry et la Division Logistique. La société exploite un réseau de routes de ferry, y compris des routes de fret uniquement, des routes de fret et de passagers combinées et des ferries; possède et exploite des terminaux portuaires et des chemins de fer; offre des services de fret aux transitaires, aux transporteurs et aux fabricants de marchandises lourdes; et fournit des services de passagers, tels que des traversées de nuit et de jour."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":8